{"4054620": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Box Box Box!", "steam_appid": 4054620, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Box Box Box!</strong> is a playful racing management game with realistic physics and driver behavior. Manage your team, plan the development of the car and decide your strategy during the race.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put together the team that better suits your strategy and develop your car race after race to make sure it's always the fastest on track.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054620/extras/6fe8856652269a7be11325ec68272d4f.avif?t=1768325246\" width=256 height=256 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch exciting races thanks to an accurate physic simulation, realistic driving behavior and several dynamic events like weather, crashes and driver's mistakes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race on several different tracks that will challenge in different ways your car and your driver.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054620/extras/3679e4c9c41cb56230f84fdfd1c71003.avif?t=1768325246\" width=256 height=256 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select your drivers from a rich cast of quirky and unique characters, each one with its own skills and abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054620/extras/bfa9f98a87df66fc0b8c84ce0c4a6499.avif?t=1768325246\" width=256 height=173 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"b