 Box Box!</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p>", "short_description": "Box Box Box! is a racing management game with a rich cast of quirky and unique characters. Manage your team, plan the development of the car, decide your race strategy and watch exciting races with realistic physics and driver behavior!", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054620/2d081dab79bb6896feadadf90ac7f4158719685d/header.jpg?t=1768325246", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054620/6975cf38d39e025e0072264e4b9b6ee297b9c446/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768325246", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054620/6975cf38d39e025e0072264e4b9b6ee297b9c446/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768325246", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core 2 Duo E8200, AMD FX-4100, Snapdragon X Elite<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD Graphics 510 (Skylake), AMD Radeon R5 Graphics (Kaveri)<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Pole"], "publishers": ["Pole"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 68, "description": "Custom Volume Controls"}, {"id": 74, "description": "Playable without Timed Input"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Family Sharing"}], "genres": [{"id": "9", "description": "Racing"}, {"id": "28", "description": "Simulation"}, {"id": "2", "description": "Strategy"}], "screenshots": [{"id": 0, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054620/b2044fe27a1a94e